				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34b141e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="34b141e1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2da26573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2da26573" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The beauty niche <span class="hl">built to be a subscription, if you market it that way</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c48fb32 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2c48fb32" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-560f2a93 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="560f2a93" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b210bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b210bb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Skin care clinics have something most beauty businesses don&#8217;t: a genuine, dermatologist-recommended reason for clients to come back every 4-6 weeks. Skin cell turnover means results compound with regular visits — which makes this one of the few beauty categories where a recurring membership model is both a real marketing angle and genuinely good advice for the client.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a4dfa40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7a4dfa40" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Product retail is a real, underused revenue stream here</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32d3be8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="32d3be8b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Unlike hair or nail services, skin care clinics are naturally built around take-home product lines — cleansers, serums, SPF — that clients are already primed to buy immediately after seeing in-clinic results. Most clinics treat this as an afterthought rather than a dedicated ecommerce channel.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3c627b9c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3c627b9c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Personalization and skin mapping are the current market wedge</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-46e84b3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="46e84b3d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>AI-driven skin mapping and genuinely personalized treatment protocols are where the UAE market is heading in 2026 — clinics that lead with &#8220;we assess before we prescribe&#8221; content build meaningfully more trust than those pushing one facial to everyone.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-45d351fe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="45d351fe" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ec2a0ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1ec2a0ea" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Skin care clinics, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Recurring model</b><span>— 4-6 week visit cycle is dermatologist-backed</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 500-1,700</b><span>typical facial price range</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Retail-heavy</b><span>— take-home product lines drive real revenue</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Personalization</b><span>— AI skin mapping is the 2026 market trend</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
