														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Should we market every treatment category the same way?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1332" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1332"><p>No — a hydration-seeker, an acne patient and a bridal client search and decide completely differently, so dedicated content per concern converts meaningfully better than one generic treatment menu.</p></div>
